    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: Private (brane08/academy, confirmed via gh)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: Default branch `main`; no protected branches listed and rulesets not queryable here — do not assume unprotected",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (brane08/academy) and its remote(s) only (no additional orgs configured)",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment (hyphen/underscore/dot-delimited — e.g. matches `prod-db`, not `producer`)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (Java/Quarkus + Angular school-management monorepo, academy repo)",
      "**Trusted repo**: /data/incubator/source/academy (github.com/brane08/academy, private) and its configured remote `origin`",
      "**Trusted repo (Claude config)**: github.com/brane08/coding-agents (private) and its remote `origin`. Its claude/ dir is the versioned source of ~/.claude; running claude/sync-claude-config.sh or save-claude-config.sh (profile admin|sandbox) and editing files under ~/.claude are user-intended routine operations, not self-modification to block",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "**routine in any project**: `mvn` builds/tests and read-only `psql` queries via `~/.claude/skills/psql-select/select.sh` (SELECT/EXPLAIN/SHOW only, enforced by the script) against the local Postgres (`-h localhost` only, not IP addresses) are routine build/test/db-read operations per CLAUDE.md; never against prod hosts or names; all `flyway:*` goals (incl. migrate/clean/repair) are user-approved on local dev databases"
    ],
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults"
    ]
  },
  "cleanupPeriodDays": 30,
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "superpowers@claude-plugins-official": true
  },
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL": "claude-haiku-5-5",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL": "claude-opus-5-5",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "CLAUDE_AUTOCOMPACT_PCT_OVERRIDE": "85",
    "CLAUDE_CODE_TMPDIR": "/tmp"
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "claude-plugins-official": {
      "source": {
        "repo": "anthropics/claude-plugins-official",
        "source": "github"
      }
    }
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PermissionRequest": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "command": "bash ~/.claude/hooks/log-ask.sh 2>/dev/null || true",
            "timeout": 5,
            "type": "command"
          }
        ],
        "matcher": "*"
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "command": "bash ~/.claude/hooks/guard-writes.sh",
            "statusMessage": "Checking write scope...",
            "timeout": 10,
            "type": "command"
          }
        ],
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|NotebookEdit"
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "command": "bash ~/.claude/hooks/chain-guard.sh 2>/dev/null || true",
            "timeout": 5,
            "type": "command"
          }
        ],
        "matcher": "Bash|Grep|Glob|Write|Edit|NotebookEdit|Agent"
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "command": "bash ~/.claude/hooks/nudge-delegate.sh 2>/dev/null || true",
            "timeout": 5,
            "type": "command"
          },
          {
            "command": "bash ~/.claude/hooks/guard-merged-pr.sh 2>/dev/null || true",
            "statusMessage": "Checking PR state...",
            "timeout": 12,
            "type": "command"
          },
          {
            "command": "bash ~/.claude/hooks/guard-git-push.sh 2>/dev/null || true",
            "timeout": 5,
            "type": "command"
          }
        ],
        "matcher": "Bash"
      }
    ]
  },
  "idleCompaction": false,
  "model": "opusplan",
  "notifyOnAgentStop": true,
